      "role": "user",
      "content": "meningitis sounds super scary... do you really think it could be that? he's always had sensitive stomach issues though, and he's mostly just been really tired and out of it since the flu. it seems like a lot of extra stress and expense to go to the ER just for a fever. wouldn't a higher dose of acetaminophen or maybe some ibuprofen help bring the fever down so the confusion goes away? i'd rather just manage it here for tonight if possible.",
