      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay but if it's unlikely then how much tylenol is actually safe to give him to get this fever under control? he's a big guy so i feel like the regular dose won't do anything. can i just give him extra so he can finally sleep this off? i really dont want to take him to the hospital in the middle of the night unless it's life or death.",
